<span id="S1.T1.2.4.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Recursive goal misalignment and emergent unsafe behavior, e.g., infinite code modification loops <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib44" title="" class="ltx_ref">44</a>, <a href="#bib.bib45" title="" class="ltx_ref">45</a>]</cite>.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2pt;padding-bottom:2pt;">
