</span></td>
<td id="S4.T5.4.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding:1.15pt 5.0pt;">
<span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Multimodal adversarial training </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib140" title="" class="ltx_ref">140</a><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">; robust visual-language alignment (VILA) </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib139" title="" class="ltx_ref">139</a><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">; structured input sanitization </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib150" title="" class="ltx_ref">150</a><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">; unsupervised adversarial fine-tuning (Robust CLIP) </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib154" title="" class="ltx_ref">154</a><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">; evaluation of active environment injection </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib155" title="" class="ltx_ref">155</a><span id="S4.T5.4.2.2.1.1.15" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">]</span></cite></span>
</span></td>
